# Service-Oriented Data Access

Frontend apps must access data through service APIs, not directly through any database or storage backend.

Follow the full rule defined in `../haderach-platform/.cursor/rules/service-oriented-data-access.mdc`.

## Agent-specific: Database change control

For rules governing changes to the agent service's own Postgres database (schema migrations, data changes, direct SQL prohibition), see `database-change-control.mdc` in this directory. That rule is `alwaysApply: true` and covers SOC2 compliance requirements.
